  "body": "## What changed\n`crates/app/tests/coarse_rims.rs`: the `Tool { .. }` literal in `thread_mill` is missing the `cutting` field added to `Tool` on main. Added `cutting: Vec::new()`, the same form as a9a4bddd. Test-only, one line.\n\n## Gate\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --no-run`: builds (0 errors). Every other `Tool {` literal in the app tests already compiles, so the compiler reports no further missing fields.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test coarse_rims`: 5 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\nOther crates' test suites (not touched). The full batch tier was not run.\n\n## Pinning\nThe existing `coarse_rims` suite (it fails to compile without this line on main).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: low\n\nfork synced at v0.18.0 (branch from upstream/main)\n\nFixes #1345\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
